lines = PackedStringArray("Coal by the pass, gold up in the foothills of the peak. You'll need a good arm for both.", "Sorting rock is half the job. The other half is carrying it home.", "Pine burns long and hot. When the smithy wants a hotter forge, that's what they'll ask for.")

